0..106 Comment "/// `absurdArm` answers an empty case on a lambda\'s binder whose type an enclosing case refined to `Void`."
107..110 Comment "///"
111..229 Comment "/// Under the arm `Zero`, the binder\'s type `isVoid(Zero)` is a call that returns `Void`, so the empty case covers it."
230..324 Comment "/// The kernel admits the declaration as the checker does, and the fixture runs the other arm."
325..328 Comment "///"
329..406 Comment "/// The checker unfolds the binder\'s type to `Void` before it reads the case."
407..519 Comment "/// The kernel reads the decode of the returned call by its own evaluator before it reads the scrutinee\'s shape."
520..523 Comment "///"
524..540 Comment "/// - see: #2830"
541..574 Comment "/// - see: `refined-binder.gandr`"
576..592 Comment "// The naturals."
